			"notes": "Fixed a Forge 1.20.1 compatibility issue where Oculus shader pack options could fall back to English when Superb Warfare was installed. The active language and the mod's English dictionary now keep separate shader language preferences.\n\n修复 Forge 1.20.1 上与卓越前线共装时，Oculus 光影包选项可能回退到英文的问题。游戏当前语言与模组的独立英语字典现各自保留光影语言顺序。"
		},
