			"notes": "## Forge 1.20.1\n\n- Fixed a crash when a mod registers a key mapping with a null category. Verified on Forge 47.4.29 with Laser Creeper Robot Dino Riders From Space 3.0.0.\n- Retains the registry holder compatibility for Forge releases that provide native per-registry dispatch.\n\n## NeoForge 1.21.1\n\n- An empty resource-listing prefix now enumerates the namespace root, including nested files. Verified with directory packs and mod JARs on NeoForge 21.1.267. Invalid paths still receive the normal diagnostic. See [#29](https://github.com/kltyton/LightSpeedRe/issues/29)."
